WEBVTT

01:38.160 --> 01:41.039
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.110 --> 01:43.990
[Episode 24]

01:47.920 --> 01:48.380
Banxia.

01:49.590 --> 01:50.450
Have some fish.

01:50.789 --> 01:52.720
I've removed all the bones for you.

01:56.000 --> 01:56.840
Chief Constable Chu,

01:56.840 --> 01:58.300
you didn't have to do that.

01:58.310 --> 01:59.430
I'd like to help.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.650
The fish here tastes great.

02:01.650 --> 02:02.180
Try some.

02:11.240 --> 02:12.560
I doubted if you knew how to get the bones out,

02:12.560 --> 02:13.960
so I removed them for you.

02:21.360 --> 02:22.360
What do you think?

02:24.240 --> 02:25.100
Have some more.

02:33.400 --> 02:34.960
This distilled liquor

02:35.030 --> 02:35.750
is very strong.

02:35.750 --> 02:36.750
Stay away from it.

02:37.680 --> 02:38.010
Here,

02:38.590 --> 02:39.390
have some tea.

02:40.560 --> 02:41.400
I'm good, Chief Constable Chu.

02:41.400 --> 02:42.540
I-I can manage on my own.

02:42.540 --> 02:44.270
You got choked. Just take a sip.

02:44.970 --> 02:45.980
I'm really good.

02:50.590 --> 02:51.850
This is the one, right?

02:52.250 --> 02:53.250
Thank you so much.

02:56.079 --> 02:57.340
What's wrong, Banxia?

02:58.590 --> 03:00.240
I just choked on the liquor.

03:12.590 --> 03:13.720
Drink some tea then.

03:14.080 --> 03:14.750
Thank you.

03:27.590 --> 03:28.990
The liquor tastes great.

03:29.600 --> 03:30.880
Li likes drinking too.

03:30.910 --> 03:31.560
He didn't join us today.

03:31.560 --> 03:32.280
What a pity.

03:33.000 --> 03:34.800
He took a leave and went back to his hometown.

03:34.800 --> 03:35.280
A leave?

03:35.400 --> 03:36.000
Why?

03:37.850 --> 03:39.000
A brother of his is getting married.

03:39.000 --> 03:40.600
He has to be there to help out.

03:41.240 --> 03:42.150
Li has never been married.

03:42.150 --> 03:42.910
What could he

03:42.910 --> 03:44.040
possibly help with?

03:45.190 --> 03:46.670
His brother already held an engagement ceremony.

03:46.670 --> 03:48.140
There is only one step left undone

03:48.140 --> 03:48.960
before the wedding.

03:48.960 --> 03:50.710
The Li family is quite influential there.

03:50.710 --> 03:53.000
The elder members will handle the worshipping of ancestors.

03:53.000 --> 03:54.680
The young only need to prepare a sedan-chair,

03:54.680 --> 03:55.910
set up the wedding room

03:55.910 --> 03:57.170
and welcome the bride.

03:57.280 --> 03:58.540
How hard could that be?

03:58.910 --> 04:00.310
You know so much about it.

04:00.630 --> 04:01.560
After all, I have

04:01.710 --> 04:03.310
been through the same thing.

04:03.310 --> 04:04.250
Seriously?

04:04.400 --> 04:05.430
You've never been married.

04:05.430 --> 04:06.470
Of course I have.

04:19.360 --> 04:20.490
That was just a joke.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.640
I've never been married.

04:39.920 --> 04:40.980
Careful. Careful.

04:47.400 --> 04:48.460
I'm telling you...

04:48.510 --> 04:49.570
Watch your tongue.

04:49.950 --> 04:50.810
Physician Jiu.

04:52.190 --> 04:53.240
Mr. Yan?

04:56.390 --> 04:57.390
You can leave now.

04:57.510 --> 04:58.710
No need to wait for me.

05:01.360 --> 05:01.890
Let's go.

05:03.070 --> 05:04.600
Shall I wait for you downstairs?

05:04.600 --> 05:05.510
No, I'm all good.

05:05.510 --> 05:06.710
You should get going.

05:06.870 --> 05:07.470
Tingzhou,

05:07.600 --> 05:08.600
take Banxia home.

05:09.360 --> 05:09.720
Okay.

05:10.120 --> 05:10.580
Chi Xue.

05:16.340 --> 05:17.480
[Yanlai Restaurant]

05:16.920 --> 05:18.120
Slow down. Slow down.

05:18.400 --> 05:20.190
You gotta be careful these days.

05:20.190 --> 05:20.800
Banxia?

05:21.950 --> 05:23.210
Didn't I tell you to go?

05:23.430 --> 05:24.830
Why are you waiting here?

05:25.040 --> 05:25.720
I don't have much

05:25.720 --> 05:26.850
to do at home anyway.

05:33.070 --> 05:34.400
What are you staring at?

05:34.680 --> 05:35.940
I have such good taste.

05:38.310 --> 05:39.510
For clothes, I meant.

05:39.870 --> 05:41.240
You were right.

05:41.270 --> 05:43.240
It would fit with a full stomach.

05:45.430 --> 05:47.240
I bought you clothes as a gift.

05:47.480 --> 05:48.600
Don't you think you should

05:48.600 --> 05:50.200
give me something in return?

05:51.800 --> 05:52.480
Well,

05:53.040 --> 05:53.970
what do you want?

05:55.310 --> 05:55.840
Let's go.

05:57.950 --> 05:58.800
Come with me.

06:14.750 --> 06:15.410
Here we are.

06:22.160 --> 06:23.190
Get some rest.

06:23.680 --> 06:25.540
I'll come to see you off tomorrow.

06:25.920 --> 06:26.380
No need.

06:28.890 --> 06:30.090
You're confused now.

06:30.430 --> 06:31.800
Before you get your head

06:32.110 --> 06:32.800
straight,

06:33.409 --> 06:34.290
it's unnecessary for us

06:34.290 --> 06:35.090
to meet again.

06:37.600 --> 06:38.530
What do you mean?

06:40.430 --> 06:41.190
I don't know what

06:41.190 --> 06:42.390
is making you do this.

06:42.630 --> 06:43.870
But when you think it through,

06:43.870 --> 06:45.360
you can come to the capital city for me.

06:45.360 --> 06:47.360
You'll have one year to mull it over.

06:49.480 --> 06:50.280
Chu Youhuang,

06:51.220 --> 06:52.680
you're not my only choice.

07:06.480 --> 07:07.080
Thank you.

07:07.990 --> 07:08.630
Enjoy.

07:14.920 --> 07:15.410
So delicious.

07:15.410 --> 07:16.050
Get a bite.

07:17.830 --> 07:19.380
If you want me to eat it,

07:19.560 --> 07:21.690
why didn't you just buy two bowls of it?

07:23.240 --> 07:25.170
One is enough for both of us.

07:29.860 --> 07:31.060
You're not eating it.

07:31.120 --> 07:32.320
Do you hate me or what?

07:33.000 --> 07:33.830
No, I don't.

07:34.870 --> 07:35.330
Come on,

07:35.510 --> 07:36.190
try some.

07:44.600 --> 07:45.730
It's good, isn't it?

07:46.290 --> 07:46.880
Yes.

07:49.870 --> 07:50.470
You eat it.

07:50.680 --> 07:51.680
It's all yours.

08:02.680 --> 08:04.010
It's quite late now.

08:04.210 --> 08:06.740
I'll take you home after you finish this bowl.

08:06.790 --> 08:08.260
So soon?

08:08.750 --> 08:10.680
I'm not done wandering around yet.

08:11.750 --> 08:12.660
You don't want

08:13.030 --> 08:15.030
your parents to get worried, do you?

08:15.210 --> 08:16.000
I already told them

08:16.000 --> 08:17.360
this would take a while when I left.

08:17.360 --> 08:18.760
Don't you worry about it.

08:22.070 --> 08:23.680
How are they doing lately?

08:24.310 --> 08:26.320
Is the medicine working?

08:27.630 --> 08:29.310
My father is much better now.

08:29.750 --> 08:30.750
But my mother

08:31.590 --> 08:32.990
still doesn't feel well.

08:33.360 --> 08:35.159
She's having dreams very often,

08:35.390 --> 08:38.049
and can't sleep without the calming fragrance.

08:38.480 --> 08:39.390
But the frequent use of it

08:39.390 --> 08:40.590
is harmful to health.

08:42.390 --> 08:42.960
Well,

08:43.360 --> 08:44.320
I'll make a

08:44.440 --> 08:45.150
nerve-soothing

08:45.150 --> 08:46.440
and sleep-aiding prescription

08:46.440 --> 08:47.570
for you to take home.

08:48.840 --> 08:49.320
Okay.

08:56.760 --> 08:58.000
Do you remember

08:58.030 --> 08:59.270
the wish we made here?

08:59.910 --> 09:02.000
Now it has come true.

09:02.550 --> 09:04.410
My parents have come back safely.

09:07.870 --> 09:09.330
However, for some reason,

09:10.720 --> 09:12.790
my mother doesn't seem to like me.

09:14.270 --> 09:15.750
She always avoids me.

09:16.670 --> 09:18.600
She speaks too politely to me.

09:19.240 --> 09:20.910
She hates it when I touch her.

09:22.690 --> 09:23.380
Xuanye,

09:25.000 --> 09:25.840
tell me.

09:26.840 --> 09:27.870
Am I not being

09:27.870 --> 09:29.200
a good enough daughter?

09:31.240 --> 09:32.360
I've grown up,

09:32.510 --> 09:33.360
but not in the way

09:33.360 --> 09:34.670
she likes.

09:34.870 --> 09:36.730
Is that why she's acting this way?

09:37.630 --> 09:38.840
You know

09:39.270 --> 09:41.200
what your mother has been through.

09:41.770 --> 09:43.680
She was a Guanyin Bodhisattva statue for over 10 years.

09:43.680 --> 09:45.210
She couldn't speak or move.

09:45.480 --> 09:48.520
Clear though her mind was, she was controlled by others.

09:48.520 --> 09:49.480
Do you know how

09:49.510 --> 09:50.710
despairing that was?

09:54.670 --> 09:55.960
She didn't commit suicide,

09:55.960 --> 09:56.630
go insane,

09:56.960 --> 09:58.560
or become completely different.

09:58.560 --> 09:59.870
It wasn't easy for her.

10:00.390 --> 10:01.360
The effects

10:01.660 --> 10:03.990
of past experiences sometimes linger on.

10:04.320 --> 10:05.520
I've seen many people

10:06.140 --> 10:06.740
who couldn't

10:06.740 --> 10:08.270
reconcile with their past.

10:09.080 --> 10:09.720
Your mother

10:09.720 --> 10:11.120
is doing a good enough job

10:11.120 --> 10:12.080
coming this far.

10:12.960 --> 10:14.220
You should be patient,

10:14.630 --> 10:16.230
and spend more time with her.

10:17.910 --> 10:18.910
You're right.

10:19.870 --> 10:21.870
I was not being considerate enough.

10:25.550 --> 10:26.880
You know so many things.

10:28.120 --> 10:30.180
I do, only when I'm compared with you.

10:35.150 --> 10:36.080
That was scary.

10:38.190 --> 10:39.080
I don't think I can

10:39.080 --> 10:41.010
enjoy fireworks shows these days.

10:44.320 --> 10:46.050
We're already back to reality.

10:46.520 --> 10:47.510
Everything in the painting

10:47.510 --> 10:48.770
was untrue, wasn't it?

10:49.030 --> 10:50.690
But it was still frightening.

10:51.360 --> 10:51.870
Banxia,

10:53.000 --> 10:54.530
have you ever thought about

10:54.680 --> 10:56.210
what your life would be like

10:56.550 --> 10:58.080
if you couldn't see demons?

11:00.910 --> 11:02.700
Very different, I assume.

11:04.150 --> 11:06.080
My life would be happier.

11:06.630 --> 11:08.390
My father would still be an official,

11:08.390 --> 11:10.250
and my mother wouldn't have left.

11:11.150 --> 11:12.320
We could've been

11:12.320 --> 11:13.520
closer to each other.

11:15.840 --> 11:18.270
I might've received education,

11:19.360 --> 11:20.690
learned to ride horses,

11:20.960 --> 11:22.620
or even studied martial arts.

11:23.030 --> 11:25.360
Aren't you describing He Quelian's life?

11:25.510 --> 11:27.710
Her life seems pretty good, doesn't it?

11:30.910 --> 11:32.370
You like that kind of life?

11:35.960 --> 11:36.620
Not really.

11:38.380 --> 11:39.060
Why?

11:40.030 --> 11:40.630
Because

11:40.630 --> 11:42.630
I wouldn't have met you in that case.

11:50.870 --> 11:51.630
Well,

11:52.200 --> 11:53.030
Xuanye,

11:54.630 --> 11:56.080
you said everything in the painting

11:56.080 --> 11:57.060
was untrue.

11:58.270 --> 11:59.460
Does that mean what you said to me

11:59.460 --> 12:00.420
was also untrue?

12:02.480 --> 12:03.610
What did I say to you?

12:05.150 --> 12:06.410
Have you forgotten it?

12:07.960 --> 12:08.870
How could you forget

12:08.870 --> 12:10.320
something that important?

12:10.320 --> 12:11.480
That day, you told me

12:11.480 --> 12:12.600
that you liked me.

12:13.270 --> 12:14.080
I remember it vividly

12:14.080 --> 12:15.550
though you don't!

12:15.910 --> 12:17.150
It happened in

12:17.150 --> 12:18.550
a similar night to this.

12:18.710 --> 12:19.960
There were many stars.

12:19.960 --> 12:21.090
The moon was hidden.

12:21.510 --> 12:22.480
Then, the moment

12:22.480 --> 12:23.860
the fireworks showed up,

12:23.860 --> 12:24.630
you told me

12:25.030 --> 12:26.120
that you liked me.

12:26.150 --> 12:26.630
You said

12:27.240 --> 12:28.000
you had kept

12:28.050 --> 12:29.400
refusing me

12:29.840 --> 12:31.270
because you didn't think

12:31.270 --> 12:32.840
we were a good match for each other.

12:32.840 --> 12:33.270
You said

12:33.270 --> 12:33.960
you lived

12:33.960 --> 12:34.960
a dangerous life as a demon hunter...

12:34.960 --> 12:36.890
Why are you bringing this up again?

12:37.750 --> 12:39.480
It's not fair to say that, is it?

12:40.390 --> 12:41.920
When I last asked you about that,

12:41.920 --> 12:42.980
Chief Constable Chu

12:42.980 --> 12:44.180
interrupted us.

12:44.220 --> 12:45.820
You didn't give me an answer.

12:48.640 --> 12:50.240
Did I not give you an answer?

12:50.920 --> 12:52.320
Did you give me an answer?

12:56.120 --> 12:57.030
It's late at night.

12:57.030 --> 12:57.960
Maybe we should go.

12:57.960 --> 12:58.480
No!

12:59.080 --> 12:59.750
We have to

12:59.750 --> 13:01.150
make things clear today.

13:02.930 --> 13:04.190
Does that mean I have to

13:04.320 --> 13:05.720
say everything out loud?

13:06.080 --> 13:06.870
Of course.

13:07.080 --> 13:07.870
It's an important issue.

13:07.870 --> 13:09.330
It must be stated clearly.

13:09.390 --> 13:10.790
You can't just

13:10.900 --> 13:12.180
patronize me, right?

13:12.650 --> 13:13.670
You must

13:13.670 --> 13:14.870
give me an answer now.

13:15.080 --> 13:16.270
Will you accept

13:16.290 --> 13:17.360
me or not?

13:17.440 --> 13:18.550
Do you like me?

13:18.570 --> 13:20.000
Do you want to be with me?

13:20.510 --> 13:21.790
If I can't get an answer today,

13:21.790 --> 13:22.270
I...

13:23.770 --> 13:27.150
♫When you're in love, you wish this love could last forever♫

13:27.560 --> 13:30.490
♫Leaning in close to whisper softly♫

13:30.740 --> 13:33.080
♫I miss you♫

13:33.310 --> 13:35.190
♫On every moonlit night♫

13:35.280 --> 13:39.570
♫Tenderness ties us together♫

13:40.820 --> 13:44.560
♫Let me take your hand and keep our promise♫

13:44.790 --> 13:45.390
Now...

13:44.820 --> 13:48.060
♫You shake my soul and pull at my heartstrings♫

13:46.240 --> 13:47.840
Have I made things clear yet?

13:48.640 --> 13:50.520
♫If I think this world is beautiful♫

13:50.540 --> 13:52.270
♫It's partly because of the moon♫

13:52.410 --> 13:55.880
♫And mostly because I met you♫

13:52.630 --> 13:53.280
Let's go.

13:56.360 --> 13:59.830
♫When life gets hard♫

14:00.310 --> 14:03.390
♫All I wish for is to stay by your side♫

14:03.930 --> 14:05.780
♫This lingering love♫

14:05.800 --> 14:07.800
♫Is a treasure we both cherish♫

14:07.830 --> 14:10.520
♫When I turn around, you're there♫

14:10.610 --> 14:13.270
♫Right by my side♫

14:16.440 --> 14:16.910
Dad.

14:20.520 --> 14:21.320
It's quite late now.

14:21.320 --> 14:22.670
Why are you standing here?

14:22.670 --> 14:24.240
I couldn't sleep anyway.

14:26.270 --> 14:28.320
Thank you for taking my daughter home.

14:28.320 --> 14:28.900
Uncle,

14:29.030 --> 14:30.230
you're very welcome.

14:30.960 --> 14:31.820
Physician Jiu,

14:31.960 --> 14:32.840
I'd like to

14:33.200 --> 14:35.270
invite you over for a gathering some time.

14:35.270 --> 14:37.130
My wife and I will treat you to wine

14:37.270 --> 14:38.730
as a gesture of gratitude.

14:39.160 --> 14:40.760
Uncle, it's very kind of you.

14:40.870 --> 14:42.790
You've thanked me many times already.

14:42.790 --> 14:43.720
I can't thank you

14:43.920 --> 14:45.050
enough for saving me

14:45.550 --> 14:46.360
and my wife.

14:47.000 --> 14:47.530
Alright.

14:47.550 --> 14:48.960
It's very late now.

14:49.000 --> 14:49.570
You've shown

14:49.570 --> 14:51.300
enough courtesy to each other.

14:51.480 --> 14:52.030
Xuanye,

14:52.270 --> 14:53.960
now that my father has invited you,

14:53.960 --> 14:55.690
you should come over some time.

14:58.120 --> 14:58.630
Okay.

14:59.750 --> 15:00.480
Bye bye then.

15:02.360 --> 15:03.420
I'll get going now.

15:04.440 --> 15:05.000
Uncle,

15:05.200 --> 15:05.970
goodbye.

15:12.750 --> 15:13.480
Come back in.

15:18.390 --> 15:18.960
Banxia,

15:20.360 --> 15:21.240
did you

15:21.790 --> 15:22.650
drink alcohol?

15:25.840 --> 15:26.960
Just a little bit.

15:31.550 --> 15:32.600
Is Mom asleep?

15:33.480 --> 15:35.440
She is weak now since she was just rescued.

15:35.440 --> 15:37.150
She is taking a rest in the room.

15:37.150 --> 15:37.750
Oh, right.

15:38.190 --> 15:40.150
What does Physician Jiu like to eat?

15:40.150 --> 15:41.280
What does he not eat?

15:42.390 --> 15:44.670
He likes...

15:45.550 --> 15:46.030
Meat.

15:46.510 --> 15:48.110
We should buy plenty of meat.

15:51.070 --> 15:52.670
Did you eat enough food at the gathering?

15:52.670 --> 15:53.270
Would you

15:53.480 --> 15:54.870
like to eat something now?

15:54.870 --> 15:55.960
I'm full.

15:56.320 --> 15:57.720
I'm a bit thirsty, though.

15:57.720 --> 15:57.910
Dad,

15:57.910 --> 15:59.910
why don't you make some tea with orange peel?

15:59.910 --> 16:00.360
Sure.

16:00.550 --> 16:02.150
Wait for it in your room then.

16:22.000 --> 16:24.910
[Gangshan Clinic]

16:30.030 --> 16:30.760
Big Brother,

16:31.030 --> 16:32.270
we've finally found you.

16:32.270 --> 16:33.000
Big Brother,

16:33.090 --> 16:34.220
you're really here.

16:38.790 --> 16:39.240
Mom,

16:39.600 --> 16:40.750
it's me, Banxia.

16:47.480 --> 16:48.870
Mom, are you asleep?

16:51.550 --> 16:53.770
I think I just saw you. Were you out?

16:55.310 --> 16:56.310
Are you asleep?

17:12.550 --> 17:13.069
Mom,

17:13.640 --> 17:15.040
were you trying to sleep?

17:15.780 --> 17:16.349
Yes.

17:21.020 --> 17:21.630
What's up?

17:23.950 --> 17:25.210
My dress needs sewing.

17:25.589 --> 17:27.109
Can you do me a favor?

17:30.030 --> 17:30.830
Come in.

17:31.720 --> 17:32.270
Okay.

17:34.640 --> 17:35.310
Big Brother.

17:35.310 --> 17:36.040
Big Brother.

17:36.310 --> 17:37.710
No need for this anymore.

17:38.160 --> 17:38.960
What happened

17:39.110 --> 17:40.510
in the painting was just a dream.

17:40.510 --> 17:42.440
You don't need to call me Big Brother anymore.

17:42.440 --> 17:44.480
Well, we'll call you

17:44.890 --> 17:46.020
Physician Jiu then.

17:47.110 --> 17:47.510
Okay.

17:48.880 --> 17:49.720
We're here

17:49.930 --> 17:51.330
to deliver a letter to you

17:51.730 --> 17:53.460
for the owner of Xiaodongtian.

17:59.350 --> 18:00.200
Xuanye,

18:00.680 --> 18:01.920
the mess caused by the Enlightenment Bookstore

18:01.920 --> 18:03.050
has been cleaned up.

18:03.070 --> 18:04.400
The other people who were brought

18:04.400 --> 18:06.860
into the painting have all gone home safely.

18:07.240 --> 18:09.100
The demon you entrusted to my care

18:09.160 --> 18:10.880
already left yesterday.

18:11.800 --> 18:14.460
Guangping is not far from the Underground City.

18:14.550 --> 18:16.750
We should often visit each other.

18:17.440 --> 18:19.240
If you encounter difficulties,

18:19.270 --> 18:20.440
just come meet me.

18:21.030 --> 18:22.890
I'll give you as much help as I can.

18:24.290 --> 18:25.220
Thank you.

18:26.230 --> 18:27.310
Let's talk inside.

18:33.310 --> 18:34.640
Mom, you're beautiful.

18:35.740 --> 18:37.200
Where does that come from?

18:37.570 --> 18:38.830
You're really pretty.

18:43.350 --> 18:44.720
Xuanye told me

18:44.970 --> 18:45.950
the time wouldn't stop ticking

18:45.950 --> 18:47.150
even in the painting.

18:48.480 --> 18:50.270
Why haven't you changed a bit?

18:52.880 --> 18:54.140
You little flatterer.

18:54.660 --> 18:56.060
I'm not buttering you up.

19:11.480 --> 19:12.030
Mom,

19:14.310 --> 19:15.970
I'm so happy that you're back.

19:18.360 --> 19:20.560
You've been through so much suffering.

19:22.240 --> 19:24.170
I promise I'll be a good girl.

19:25.340 --> 19:27.940
I'll never upset you. I'll always cheer you up.

19:30.110 --> 19:32.150
We'll lead a happy life as a family

19:32.780 --> 19:34.240
and never be parted again.

19:41.350 --> 19:43.070
I went to your room, but you weren't there.

19:43.070 --> 19:44.750
It turns out you're here.

19:45.760 --> 19:47.550
I was asking Mom to fix my dress.

19:48.680 --> 19:49.310
It's done.

19:49.720 --> 19:51.030
Your mom is bad at this.

19:51.440 --> 19:52.240
You should have

19:52.240 --> 19:53.700
asked me for help instead.

19:53.750 --> 19:54.480
Nonsense.

19:54.750 --> 19:56.680
Mom's much better than you at this.

19:56.750 --> 19:57.600
It's pretty late now.

19:57.600 --> 19:58.440
I've placed the orange peel tea

19:58.440 --> 19:59.270
in your room.

19:59.790 --> 20:00.390
Off you go.

20:00.640 --> 20:01.110
Okay.

20:02.160 --> 20:03.020
Thank you, Mom.

20:04.050 --> 20:04.710
Goodnight.

20:14.660 --> 20:16.250
How did you raise her?

20:16.590 --> 20:17.590
Why is she

20:17.750 --> 20:18.750
so glib-tongued?

20:19.280 --> 20:20.160
You're apparently

20:20.160 --> 20:20.830
pleased.

20:21.110 --> 20:22.570
Have I not taught her well?

20:24.850 --> 20:25.350
Come on.

20:28.740 --> 20:29.190
Well,

20:29.790 --> 20:31.430
I don't know your names yet.

20:31.680 --> 20:32.680
I am Xiang Shan.

20:32.940 --> 20:33.900
I am Xiang Feng.

20:37.030 --> 20:37.890
Physician Jiu,

20:38.110 --> 20:39.550
my two brothers and I

20:39.830 --> 20:41.110
may seem rude to you.

20:42.070 --> 20:43.310
In the Underground City,

20:43.310 --> 20:44.650
we must have offended you.

20:44.650 --> 20:46.710
I apologize for that, Physician Jiu.

20:46.720 --> 20:48.520
It's water under the bridge now.

20:50.070 --> 20:51.030
As I recall,

20:51.030 --> 20:52.680
the three of you were always together.

20:52.680 --> 20:54.090
Why did only you two

20:54.480 --> 20:55.610
enter the painting?

21:01.500 --> 21:02.300
Two years ago,

21:03.350 --> 21:04.000
we took on a task

21:04.000 --> 21:05.530
of looking for Lord Xin'an.

21:06.240 --> 21:08.840
We stayed in the Underground City thereafter.

21:08.920 --> 21:09.640
That night,

21:10.200 --> 21:11.070
we heard

21:12.030 --> 21:15.160
that the Lord had visited the Enlightenment Bookstore.

21:15.550 --> 21:16.480
We also found

21:16.960 --> 21:18.560
that bookstore suspicious,

21:19.200 --> 21:21.240
so we decided to go there at night.

21:21.400 --> 21:23.600
Those people were surprisingly alert.

21:23.920 --> 21:25.550
They noticed us right after we entered the store.

21:25.550 --> 21:28.010
Our youngest brother was killed on the spot,

21:28.120 --> 21:30.520
while we two were sucked into the painting.

21:30.640 --> 21:31.590
Our mistake was

21:31.590 --> 21:32.960
that we overestimated

21:32.960 --> 21:33.920
ourselves.

21:34.680 --> 21:36.480
If you hadn't come to our rescue,

21:36.830 --> 21:38.360
I'm afraid we would have...

21:42.180 --> 21:43.510
I'm sorry for your loss.

21:44.550 --> 21:45.410
Physician Jiu,

21:46.400 --> 21:47.460
we'll never forget

21:48.000 --> 21:49.720
that you're our lifesaver.

21:50.200 --> 21:50.960
Yes.

21:51.160 --> 21:52.550
If you ever need a favor,

21:52.570 --> 21:54.570
we'll do anything we can to help you.

21:55.030 --> 21:56.230
It's very kind of you.

21:57.200 --> 21:58.480
In the painting,

21:58.830 --> 22:00.290
you also gave me much help.

22:00.880 --> 22:02.640
Let's say we're even.

22:03.180 --> 22:04.240
It's getting late.

22:05.050 --> 22:07.180
We should probably get going.

22:09.410 --> 22:10.740
Now is too late.

22:11.070 --> 22:12.310
Why don't you spend the night here

22:12.310 --> 22:13.350
and leave tomorrow?

22:13.350 --> 22:14.350
We need to carry

22:14.350 --> 22:16.440
our brother's coffin back to our hometown.

22:16.440 --> 22:18.030
We can't delay it.

22:18.750 --> 22:19.310
Indeed.

22:30.550 --> 22:31.280
Big Brother,

22:31.720 --> 22:33.380
we're grateful for your help.

22:33.830 --> 22:34.310
I hope

22:35.200 --> 22:36.400
we will meet again soon.

22:36.400 --> 22:37.130
Big Brother,

22:37.160 --> 22:37.880
see you.

22:40.510 --> 22:41.510
See you.

22:48.920 --> 22:50.270
We'll go there together.

22:50.270 --> 22:50.650
Okay.

22:55.620 --> 22:56.950
Ladies, take your pick.

22:56.960 --> 22:58.130
They're all fresh, miss.

22:58.130 --> 22:59.790
All freshly slaughtered this morning.

22:59.790 --> 23:00.590
New arrivals.

23:00.590 --> 23:01.790
It is wrapped for you.

23:02.560 --> 23:03.470
Chickens for sale!

23:03.470 --> 23:04.550
High-quality silkies!

23:04.550 --> 23:05.070
Sir,

23:05.160 --> 23:06.110
what is this?

23:06.680 --> 23:07.340
Look, miss.

23:07.750 --> 23:08.640
It's a specialty of Jiangshan,

23:08.640 --> 23:09.570
named "silkie."

23:09.830 --> 23:11.690
You can fry it or make soup with it.

23:11.880 --> 23:12.720
It's nutritious,

23:12.720 --> 23:14.520
and it helps to replenish blood.

23:14.750 --> 23:15.480
Sounds good.

23:15.930 --> 23:16.750
Shall we buy a silkie

23:16.750 --> 23:17.950
and make soup with it?

23:18.510 --> 23:18.880
Okay.

23:19.160 --> 23:19.960
We'll take one.

23:19.960 --> 23:20.400
Got it!

23:22.200 --> 23:22.720
Banxia,

23:22.890 --> 23:23.590
when shall we

23:23.590 --> 23:24.830
invite Physician Jiu over for a meal?

23:24.830 --> 23:25.480
Yeah.

23:25.880 --> 23:26.880
Don't call him Physician Jiu.

23:26.880 --> 23:28.480
Just address him by his name.

23:29.350 --> 23:30.680
That's inappropriate, is it?

23:30.680 --> 23:32.040
He saved all of us.

23:32.060 --> 23:33.550
We're deeply indebted to him.

23:33.550 --> 23:35.750
We should be respectful and polite to him.

23:35.750 --> 23:37.240
Your reverence

23:37.270 --> 23:38.920
will scare him away.

23:40.480 --> 23:41.270
Why is that?

23:47.590 --> 23:48.240
Are you two

23:48.260 --> 23:48.920
already...

23:49.580 --> 23:50.340
No!

23:52.240 --> 23:54.310
Just don't call him Physician Jiu.

23:54.920 --> 23:56.420
It makes him sound like a grandpa.

23:56.420 --> 23:57.830
Just call him Xuanye.

24:05.430 --> 24:05.910
Banxia!

24:09.960 --> 24:10.310
Sir,

24:10.380 --> 24:11.110
here you are.

24:11.270 --> 24:11.750
How much?

24:11.750 --> 24:12.680
20 copper coins.

24:13.240 --> 24:14.310
The medicine in Ganshan Clinic

24:14.310 --> 24:15.110
really doesn't cost much.

24:15.110 --> 24:16.000
Their prices are 20% lower

24:16.000 --> 24:17.640
than those of Changping Clinic.

24:17.640 --> 24:18.240
That's because

24:18.240 --> 24:20.100
nobody buys from Ganshan Clinic.

24:20.270 --> 24:21.270
A case happened there six years ago.

24:21.270 --> 24:22.270
Haven't you heard about it?

24:22.270 --> 24:23.070
Six years ago?

24:23.070 --> 24:23.670
What case?

24:25.240 --> 24:25.880
Listen,

24:26.310 --> 24:27.570
six years ago, a murder

24:27.590 --> 24:28.520
happened there.

24:29.510 --> 24:30.550
Don't you know that?

24:30.550 --> 24:31.070
No.

24:31.100 --> 24:33.300
The whole neighborhood knows about it.

25:29.310 --> 25:30.480
Summon blood with blood.

25:30.480 --> 25:31.140
Summon eyes with eyes.

25:31.140 --> 25:32.170
Summon a life with a life.

25:32.170 --> 25:33.830
Summon a spirit with a spirit.

25:34.070 --> 25:35.160
Black covers the black head.

25:35.160 --> 25:36.510
Cloud conceals the cloud tail.

25:36.510 --> 25:38.170
Demon Ancestors are supreme.

25:38.240 --> 25:40.920
The world is in the primal chaos of heaven and earth.

25:40.920 --> 25:41.640
Go!

26:00.950 --> 26:01.860
I found you.

27:45.970 --> 27:48.030
No wonder Lou Ying couldn't find you.

27:58.790 --> 27:59.850
What is this place?

28:18.560 --> 28:24.900
[Ganshan Clinic]

28:54.200 --> 28:54.790
Xuanye?

29:03.460 --> 29:04.040
Xuanye,

29:04.070 --> 29:05.530
why are you standing here?

29:29.750 --> 29:30.950
Xuanye, are you okay?

29:54.920 --> 29:55.440
Banxia?

29:56.640 --> 29:58.240
Yes, it's me. What happened?

30:23.970 --> 30:24.780
How are you?

30:25.200 --> 30:26.530
Are you feeling better?

30:27.200 --> 30:27.960
I'm fine.

30:30.030 --> 30:30.750
Why did you

30:30.750 --> 30:31.750
go outside?

30:33.220 --> 30:34.170
I don't know.

30:34.790 --> 30:36.350
Maybe I had a nightmare.

30:42.110 --> 30:42.910
What's wrong?

30:46.000 --> 30:47.200
Why are you bleeding?

30:47.830 --> 30:49.290
H-How did you get injured?

31:14.270 --> 31:15.160
A Moon Bug?

31:17.270 --> 31:18.890
Did it bite you?

31:19.340 --> 31:20.740
But why would it hurt you?

31:23.240 --> 31:24.870
Maybe I was sleepwalking,

31:25.270 --> 31:27.240
and somehow offended the bugs in the dream.

31:27.240 --> 31:28.440
Don't talk nonsense.

31:29.350 --> 31:30.480
How long has it been since you fed them?

31:30.480 --> 31:31.410
Are they hungry?

31:33.590 --> 31:34.480
Possibly.

31:35.290 --> 31:37.480
I remember you saying that they like soup made with lamb lungs.

31:37.480 --> 31:38.720
When the morning market opens tomorrow,

31:38.720 --> 31:40.400
I'll go buy some to make soup.

31:41.550 --> 31:41.960
Okay.

31:57.830 --> 31:59.480
It'll be a while before this is done.

31:59.480 --> 32:01.030
You don't have to keep watch on it.

32:01.030 --> 32:01.720
It's okay.

32:01.880 --> 32:03.800
I don't have better things to do anyway.

32:03.800 --> 32:05.310
These Moon Bugs must be starving.

32:05.310 --> 32:06.590
That's why they bit you.

32:06.590 --> 32:08.250
I'll make them plenty of soup.

32:11.070 --> 32:11.730
Let me do it.

32:13.920 --> 32:14.380
Come on.

32:20.440 --> 32:21.040
Oh, right.

32:21.440 --> 32:23.370
After I walked you home that night,

32:23.550 --> 32:26.010
did your father say anything unusual to you?

32:26.480 --> 32:27.000
No.

32:27.070 --> 32:27.870
Why do you ask?

32:29.160 --> 32:29.760
No reason.

32:30.200 --> 32:31.930
I was just worried that he might

32:31.960 --> 32:34.000
reprimand you for drinking alcohol.

32:34.000 --> 32:35.750
I only drank a teensy bit.

32:36.440 --> 32:37.070
Plus,

32:37.160 --> 32:38.310
my dad is really nice to me.

32:38.310 --> 32:40.370
He wouldn't say anything harsh to me.

32:41.110 --> 32:41.840
Glad to know.

32:57.590 --> 32:58.720
What's on your mind?

33:01.160 --> 33:01.720
Nothing.

33:03.550 --> 33:04.160
Really?

33:07.880 --> 33:08.440
Banxia,

33:09.160 --> 33:10.560
last night on the street,

33:11.030 --> 33:12.290
was there anything odd

33:13.680 --> 33:15.110
about me when you saw me?

33:18.720 --> 33:20.120
You were wandering alone

33:20.510 --> 33:22.030
on the street at midnight.

33:22.270 --> 33:23.600
Wasn't that odd enough?

33:27.030 --> 33:28.160
Don't worry.

33:28.510 --> 33:29.310
I won't make fun of you

33:29.310 --> 33:30.910
just because you sleepwalk.

33:34.790 --> 33:35.690
You see,

33:35.720 --> 33:37.920
I've memorized every word of the mantra

33:38.030 --> 33:40.200
and the esoteric formula of the lightness skill.

33:40.200 --> 33:41.440
But why don't things go smoothly

33:41.440 --> 33:42.310
when I use it?

33:45.640 --> 33:47.110
That was just a dream.

33:47.680 --> 33:49.680
Are you really taking it seriously?

33:54.030 --> 33:55.470
The martial arts school was untrue.

33:55.470 --> 33:57.100
So were those martial arts skills.

33:57.100 --> 33:58.250
When the rules set by the Dream Demon

33:58.250 --> 33:59.450
don't apply anymore,

33:59.480 --> 34:01.540
everything will collapse on its own.

34:01.920 --> 34:02.720
You didn't become

34:02.720 --> 34:04.320
a martial arts master at all.

34:09.230 --> 34:10.690
People can't achieve much

34:10.710 --> 34:11.840
in martial arts

34:11.840 --> 34:13.110
without constant practice

34:13.110 --> 34:14.550
and training that could

34:14.710 --> 34:15.590
last for years.

34:15.630 --> 34:17.090
It's about accumulation.

34:17.110 --> 34:18.920
It's too good to be true if one can become a master

34:18.920 --> 34:20.520
after having a dream, right?

34:27.710 --> 34:29.440
You want to learn martial arts?

34:32.150 --> 34:33.010
How about this?

34:34.190 --> 34:36.050
If you're not afraid of hardship,

34:36.190 --> 34:37.150
I can teach you some

34:37.150 --> 34:38.590
self-defense techniques.

34:38.590 --> 34:40.670
Can't I learn something else?

34:40.920 --> 34:42.480
I want to be equipped with proper martial skills,

34:42.480 --> 34:44.409
so that I can catch demons with you.

34:44.590 --> 34:45.920
That is very dangerous.

34:46.830 --> 34:48.800
Keeping in good health should be

34:48.800 --> 34:50.000
your purpose instead.

34:50.000 --> 34:51.370
Don't underestimate me.

34:51.370 --> 34:52.840
What if I'm blessed with huge talent

34:52.840 --> 34:53.880
and a great body

34:54.320 --> 34:56.719
that make me a natural-born martial artist

34:57.070 --> 34:58.320
just like He Quelian?

35:05.220 --> 35:05.870
It's done.

35:07.550 --> 35:08.610
What are you doing?

35:09.960 --> 35:11.820
You think you'd never get burned?

35:15.070 --> 35:15.730
Let me do it.

35:19.670 --> 35:21.440
I used to think of it as a joke

35:22.840 --> 35:24.880
that some drama performers

35:25.090 --> 35:27.490
would mistake their shows for the reality.

35:27.540 --> 35:29.340
But now, I'm acting the same way.

35:37.370 --> 35:39.070
I hope the Moon Bugs will stop their craziness

35:39.070 --> 35:40.430
after eating this.

35:54.320 --> 35:57.860
[Ganshan Clinic]

36:01.390 --> 36:04.370
[Li’s Tavern]

36:03.070 --> 36:03.550
You...

36:04.000 --> 36:04.520
Chief,

36:05.000 --> 36:05.760
why did you

36:05.800 --> 36:07.130
get drunk so fast today?

36:07.350 --> 36:08.460
Not only today.

36:08.840 --> 36:10.550
He's been like this every day recently.

36:10.550 --> 36:11.870
He seems distraught.

36:13.230 --> 36:13.630
Chief.

36:14.510 --> 36:14.920
Chief,

36:14.990 --> 36:15.720
more liquor?

36:17.550 --> 36:18.680
No, I'm done with it.

36:19.230 --> 36:20.090
I have to go now.

36:21.320 --> 36:23.180
Someone's waiting for me at home.

36:24.230 --> 36:25.400
Who's waiting?

36:28.360 --> 36:29.230
My wife.

36:31.760 --> 36:33.440
You don't really have a wife, do you?

36:33.440 --> 36:35.100
You must've had a dream again.

36:41.880 --> 36:42.360
Miss,

36:42.380 --> 36:43.710
are you shopping for grocery?

36:43.710 --> 36:45.400
The vegetables are very fresh today.

36:45.400 --> 36:46.600
I'll come back later.

36:46.710 --> 36:47.360
Okay.

36:48.070 --> 36:48.840
Hello, miss.

36:50.050 --> 36:51.510
Are your parents with you?

36:53.280 --> 36:54.680
They're resting at home.

36:55.710 --> 36:57.280
This pig was just slaughtered this morning.

36:57.280 --> 36:58.230
The meat is fresh.

36:58.230 --> 36:58.710
Look,

36:58.890 --> 36:59.840
I especially saved

36:59.840 --> 37:00.900
this piece for you.

37:04.440 --> 37:06.480
Isn't that the younger son of the Jiu family?

37:06.480 --> 37:07.280
What Jiu family?

37:07.280 --> 37:08.280
There's only one, isn't it?

37:08.280 --> 37:12.010
The owner of Ganshan Clinic, where a murder happened six years ago.

37:13.230 --> 37:14.030
You're right.

37:14.240 --> 37:16.230
He is the younger son of the Jiu family.

37:16.230 --> 37:18.070
He's not just running a clinic now,

37:18.070 --> 37:20.040
but also working for the government.

37:20.040 --> 37:21.480
He solved a big case not long ago,

37:21.480 --> 37:23.600
and was even commended by the governor.

37:23.600 --> 37:25.320
Physician Jiu has excellent medical skills.

37:25.320 --> 37:26.710
He is also an exceptional

37:26.710 --> 37:27.400
osteopath.

37:27.590 --> 37:28.190
Plus, I've noticed

37:28.190 --> 37:29.620
that the prices of the medicinal materials

37:29.620 --> 37:31.480
in his clinic are much lower than those of others.

37:31.480 --> 37:32.280
Guys,

37:32.280 --> 37:33.510
if you need medical help,

37:33.510 --> 37:34.710
just go to his clinic.

37:36.520 --> 37:37.250
Miss,

37:37.590 --> 37:38.610
I'll give you a big discount

37:38.610 --> 37:39.920
on this piece of meat!

37:41.270 --> 37:42.400
Thank you, Mr. Wang.

37:47.590 --> 37:48.400
Why did you

37:48.920 --> 37:49.760
say all that stuff

37:49.760 --> 37:50.690
to those people?

37:51.520 --> 37:52.770
You did good deeds.

37:52.800 --> 37:54.400
Why not let more people know?

37:55.060 --> 37:56.000
You're hunting demons

37:56.000 --> 37:57.730
to protect the local citizens.

37:58.000 --> 38:00.110
It's fine that they don't want to show gratitude.

38:00.110 --> 38:00.920
But they shouldn't have

38:00.920 --> 38:02.980
taken that attitude with you, right?

38:02.980 --> 38:04.110
Sometimes,

38:04.110 --> 38:05.590
you might not care about something,

38:05.590 --> 38:07.450
but others would make stories up.

38:07.840 --> 38:08.880
The situation will only get worse

38:08.880 --> 38:10.030
in this way.

38:10.500 --> 38:11.810
Interpersonal relationships

38:11.810 --> 38:13.470
are all about communication.

38:16.360 --> 38:17.020
Here we are.

38:20.960 --> 38:21.670
For what?

38:23.250 --> 38:25.050
Buying presents for my parents.

38:25.070 --> 38:27.200
Aren't you coming to my home for a meal?

38:27.840 --> 38:29.830
Don't your parents mean for it

38:30.010 --> 38:31.470
as a gesture of gratitude?

38:31.840 --> 38:33.500
Why would I buy them presents?

38:33.710 --> 38:36.070
Y-You should show them respect

38:36.090 --> 38:37.380
since they're elders.

38:37.410 --> 38:39.000
That is what courtesy is.

38:39.550 --> 38:40.480
What's more,

38:41.480 --> 38:42.710
you and I...

38:43.320 --> 38:43.850
We're...

38:46.430 --> 38:47.960
What's going on between us?

38:49.590 --> 38:50.990
You honestly don't know?

38:52.680 --> 38:54.140
What are you trying to say?

38:59.540 --> 39:01.600
You're just pretending, aren't you?

39:01.700 --> 39:02.950
I'm not pretending.

39:03.560 --> 39:04.410
You are!

39:11.630 --> 39:12.360
Dad, Mom,

39:12.760 --> 39:13.510
Xuanye bought

39:13.510 --> 39:14.960
these medicinal materials for you.

39:14.960 --> 39:15.960
They provide nutrition

39:15.960 --> 39:17.560
and strengthen your bodies.

39:17.630 --> 39:18.190
He said

39:18.190 --> 39:19.760
that you must be in poor health since you were trapped

39:19.760 --> 39:21.290
in the painting for so long.

39:21.480 --> 39:22.510
Exercise and nutritious food

39:22.510 --> 39:24.400
will help with your recovery.

39:27.400 --> 39:28.460
Thank you, Physician Jiu.

39:28.460 --> 39:29.790
You saved me and my wife

39:30.110 --> 39:31.590
from the painting.

39:31.760 --> 39:33.820
Before we could repay your kindness,

39:33.880 --> 39:36.360
you've brought us so many gifts.

39:36.590 --> 39:37.960
How mortifying.

39:39.000 --> 39:40.330
Please accept my gifts.

39:41.260 --> 39:42.320
I am a demon hunter.

39:42.330 --> 39:43.860
It's my job to catch demons.

39:44.710 --> 39:45.770
You two are elders.

39:45.880 --> 39:47.400
Since this is my first visit,

39:47.400 --> 39:49.400
I should at least show some respect.

39:51.760 --> 39:52.880
Let's go to eat.

39:54.190 --> 39:54.630
Okay.

39:54.880 --> 39:56.280
Physician Jiu, this way.

39:57.510 --> 39:58.370
Physician Jiu,

39:59.070 --> 40:00.200
we will never forget

40:00.630 --> 40:01.960
how you saved our lives.

40:02.440 --> 40:03.770
It's kind of you to say that, Uncle Duan.

40:03.770 --> 40:05.070
You can just call me Xuanye.

40:05.070 --> 40:07.150
Please stop calling me Physician Jiu.

40:07.150 --> 40:08.030
Yeah.

40:08.480 --> 40:09.880
Unnecessary formality, isn't it?

40:09.880 --> 40:10.670
And you,

40:10.670 --> 40:12.150
make yourself at home.

40:12.820 --> 40:13.300
Come on.

40:14.030 --> 40:14.630
Thank you.

40:16.590 --> 40:17.400
You often

40:17.870 --> 40:19.260
deal with demons.

40:20.110 --> 40:22.070
I suppose it's very dangerous.

40:24.000 --> 40:26.080
Xuanye is not only a demon hunter.

40:26.680 --> 40:28.600
He also owns the nearby clinic.

40:29.070 --> 40:31.330
When he doesn't have to catch demons,

40:31.360 --> 40:32.530
he'd receive patients.

40:32.530 --> 40:33.920
Young though he is,

40:34.150 --> 40:35.880
he's a real master of magic skills.

40:35.880 --> 40:36.440
Most demons

40:36.440 --> 40:37.630
are no match for him.

40:37.880 --> 40:39.120
He can easily catch demons

40:39.120 --> 40:41.600
like cats catching mice.

40:42.850 --> 40:43.690
Silly girl,

40:43.920 --> 40:45.800
what kind of lousy analogy is that?

40:45.800 --> 40:47.000
Anyway, just don't worry

40:47.000 --> 40:48.400
about your lifesaver.

40:48.590 --> 40:49.590
He's really good.

40:53.880 --> 40:54.880
We're out of wine.

40:56.230 --> 40:57.160
I'll go get some.

41:01.000 --> 41:02.160
Banxia

41:02.510 --> 41:03.440
is unruly

41:04.190 --> 41:05.320
and undisciplined.

41:05.440 --> 41:07.370
She must've caused trouble to you.

41:08.190 --> 41:09.720
Uncle Duan, Banxia is fine.

41:10.590 --> 41:11.840
Some time later,

41:11.860 --> 41:13.000
after we recover,

41:13.230 --> 41:14.670
we'll go back to Nanyang.

41:15.480 --> 41:17.840
It's time we made arrangements

41:17.860 --> 41:19.190
for Banxia's marriage.

41:19.590 --> 41:20.480
Thanks to you,

41:20.960 --> 41:22.040
we could live to

41:22.140 --> 41:24.300
see Banxia get married.

41:25.030 --> 41:25.630
By the way,

41:26.190 --> 41:27.680
has Banxia told you

41:27.710 --> 41:29.240
about her future marriage?

41:30.400 --> 41:31.630
She is engaged to

41:31.710 --> 41:33.010
my friend's son.

41:33.730 --> 41:34.920
He is a well-educated

41:34.920 --> 41:36.190
and reliable

41:36.630 --> 41:38.230
young man.

41:38.650 --> 41:40.070
As parents,

41:40.730 --> 41:43.390
we wish for nothing but a stable life for Banxia.

41:44.590 --> 41:46.320
We just hope Banxia

41:46.670 --> 41:48.190
can marry a nice guy

41:48.280 --> 41:49.840
and lead a peaceful life.

41:51.030 --> 41:51.630
That's all

41:52.320 --> 41:53.440
we've ever wanted.

41:57.750 --> 42:03.470
[Qingche Hall]

41:59.320 --> 42:00.560
When I was away,

42:00.590 --> 42:01.990
what did my dad say to you?

42:02.780 --> 42:03.910
Nothing important.

42:04.840 --> 42:05.790
A new tavern is said

42:05.790 --> 42:07.320
to have opened on the east street.

42:07.320 --> 42:09.060
The raw fish there tastes amazing.

42:09.060 --> 42:10.590
Shall we go there some time?

42:11.190 --> 42:11.800
Sure.

42:14.710 --> 42:15.720
Go back to your parents.

42:15.720 --> 42:16.850
No need to see me off.

42:16.930 --> 42:18.400
Your dad drank a lot of wine.

42:18.400 --> 42:20.330
You should fix him a hangover cure.

42:20.600 --> 42:21.800
I'll do the cooking and bring

42:21.800 --> 42:23.110
some to you then, alright?

42:23.110 --> 42:23.880
No need.

42:24.150 --> 42:25.030
This amount of wine

42:25.030 --> 42:26.360
can't do anything to me.

42:27.000 --> 42:28.060
I'll get going now.

42:42.310 --> 42:43.710
Has Banxia told you about

42:43.730 --> 42:44.930
her future marriage?

42:46.440 --> 42:47.550
She is engaged to

42:47.880 --> 42:49.070
my friend's son.

42:49.880 --> 42:51.030
He is a well-educated

42:51.030 --> 42:52.280
and reliable

42:52.710 --> 42:54.360
young man.

42:55.380 --> 42:56.580
My Lady, you're back.

42:57.190 --> 42:57.840
Banxia!

42:58.920 --> 43:00.180
Come here. Sit with us.

43:04.270 --> 43:04.710
Dad,

43:04.860 --> 43:05.400
Mom.

43:06.220 --> 43:06.900
Take a seat.

43:07.440 --> 43:07.960
Okay.

43:11.010 --> 43:12.410
Did Physician Jiu leave?

43:15.310 --> 43:16.770
You're quite close to him,

43:17.480 --> 43:18.190
aren't you?

43:21.000 --> 43:21.590
Yes.

43:22.680 --> 43:23.400
Xuanye's father

43:23.400 --> 43:24.880
was also a demon hunter.

43:25.320 --> 43:27.130
On his deathbed, he specifically

43:27.130 --> 43:28.550
told him not to go to the Underground City.

43:28.550 --> 43:30.680
But in order to help me save your lives,

43:30.840 --> 43:32.970
he disobeyed his father's last order.

43:33.670 --> 43:34.930
He treats me very well.

43:40.550 --> 43:41.030
Dad,

43:41.520 --> 43:43.320
have you written to Uncle Li yet?

43:46.630 --> 43:47.880
To cancel the engagement.

43:47.880 --> 43:49.030
Have you forgotten it?

43:49.030 --> 43:49.400
No,

43:50.190 --> 43:50.790
I haven't.

43:52.000 --> 43:53.200
How could I forget it?

43:54.480 --> 43:55.720
You told me

43:56.890 --> 43:59.000
that you arranged that marriage for me

43:59.000 --> 44:00.110
to keep me away

44:00.440 --> 44:02.030
from the demons.

44:02.760 --> 44:04.620
Now that you and Mom are both safe,

44:04.850 --> 44:06.710
you don't need to worry about that anymore.

44:06.710 --> 44:08.510
Plus, given my special left eye,

44:09.150 --> 44:10.960
I'm afraid I'll bring harm

44:11.220 --> 44:12.280
to Uncle Li and Li Xian

44:12.280 --> 44:14.280
if I marry into their family, right?

44:18.760 --> 44:19.440
Banxia,

44:19.920 --> 44:21.540
that's not the only reason

44:21.960 --> 44:24.220
you're rejecting this marriage, right?

44:27.130 --> 44:27.760
Right.

44:29.400 --> 44:31.550
What you're thinking is correct.
